14662,McDonald's,Fast food restaurant,"111 Madison St, Oak Park, IL 60302, United States",41.8796564,-87.7779131,"1,454",3 weeks ago,"Just to preface, I'm not a McDonald's regular so I don't know what the norm is for this location.
